MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The idle blank's fb_blank(4) path reaches the LCD block as a single
write pair: +0x2000=0x10 (disable_fb, the engine stop) then the
+0x2008=0x80 stop-done W1C ack (the v0.92 diag trail; the whole boot
trail holds exactly one +0x2000=0x10, at the 30 s idle blank). The
fb_blank(0) unblank writes the panel-on group the probe's display-on
path uses (+0x200c=0x20180, +0x2014=0x30, +0x8000=0x61). The backlight
brightness surface does NOT touch the PWM block: pwm_backlight's
update_status drives a GPIO via gpiod_direction_output_raw (the
brightness 0/60 sysfs probes produced zero PWM MMIO writes; the
periodic +0x80/+0x84 writes are the leds_pwm/TCU tick), so panel-dark
is latched from the LCD registers alone.

The display surface now renders pure black while the blanked latch is
set (the real panel's backlight is off; the touch cursor overlay is
skipped too — nothing is visible on a dark panel). The latch clears on
the +0x200c panel-on write or on the next frame kick (the
brightness-restore wake ends with the GUI rendering again; the blanked
GUI never kicks — verified: no +0x1004 between the stop and the
panel-on writes). This is the v0.91 bisect's recommended lever: the
feed kept showing a bright picker (mean luminance 244.6) while the
touch was dead for all but ~25-30 s of the ~5-min idle cycle; now the
blank is visible (mean 0.0) and the picker returns on the unblank.

Verified (pristine nand ae41e974..., worktree build): picker lit
(244.6) -> 30 s idle blank -> screendump mean 0.0 (pure black; a tap
and an Esc key leave it black — the stock wizard wake-gates stay
closed, v0.78/0.91) -> echo 0 > /sys/class/graphics/fb0/blank
(fb_blank(0)) -> the picker returns (244.6) -> an in-window QMP tap
still selects English (the wizard advances to the Region page, the
v0.91 (a) recipe through the modified model) -> a second blank/wake
cycle renders dark and restores the Region page; the held tap after
the wake counts 13 hyn_ts IRQs (press + 20 ms held ticks + lift, the
v0.78 touch contract). The blanked latch migrates (VMSTATE_BOOL_V 2 on
x1600-lcd; a dark-state save/restore round-trip comes up still dark).
Boot gate PASS (296 distinct messages, 158 structural lines vs
boot-baseline-v0.89; the blank happens post-window).
